    "description": "Take your car shopping on the go with Auto Navigator. Whether you\u2019re looking to buy a new car or a used car, we\u2019re here to help you find a new ride that works for both you and your finances.\r\n\r\nWondering how Auto Navigator works? It\u2019s pretty simple:\r\n \r\nSHOP FOR THE PERFECT CAR:\r\nChoose from millions of new cars and used cars for sale nationwide to find the one you love. Whether you\u2019re looking for your first car or a family car, we have plenty of vehicle options for you to choose from. When you find a car you\u2019re interested in, you can save it to compare with other cars you\u2019ve favorited.\r\n\r\nCUSTOMIZE YOUR SEARCH:\r\nYour next car is out there, just tell us what you\u2019re looking for and what matters most to you in a new ride. You can filter by make, model, year, body style, price, mileage, fuel economy and more to narrow your search and find your next car quicker. Once you\u2019ve found a car you like, you can call the dealer directly from the app to ask questions and check the availability of the car.\r\n\r\nGET REAL MONTHLY PAYMENTS:\r\nPre-qualify for an auto loan in minutes (don\u2019t worry, it won\u2019t impact your credit score). After you\u2019re pre-qualified, you\u2019ll be able to see your real rate and monthly payment while you shop for cars. That means no more guessing if a car fits your finances or not.\r\n\r\nFINANCING THAT FITS YOU\r\nAdjust things like down payment and term length to build a deal that\u2019s right for you. You can even compare monthly payments side by side to narrow down the best option for you.\r\n\r\nSEE WHAT\u2019S AHEAD\r\nAlways know what\u2019s next in your car-buying journey with Next Steps\u2014a checklist to get you ready for the dealer and into your next car. Here, you can keep track of how many days are left in your pre-qualification and find out what else you can do to prepare for your dealership visit.\r\n\r\n \r\nSAVE TIME AT THE DEALER\r\nBring us with you to the dealer to make your car-buying process a little easier. Just show the dealer you\u2019re pre-qualified with Capital One Auto Navigator, complete a credit application to finish up your financing then drive off the lot in your new car.\r\n \r\nAll set to start your car-buying journey? We\u2019re ready when you are. Download today to start car shopping and find the perfect ride (and price tag).",
